-- Spatial recurrence (ex46), Version A: one stencil step, shift not carry. Twin of 089-spatial-recurrence.bqn (first assertion).
-- A row of cells and the statement that looks like Fibonacci but is one synchronous step: prev shifts, nothing carries.
-- prev shifts the pre-state with zero fill. This barrier performs one two-back stencil step; it does not carry Fibonacci values. The -c twin uses registered fib(index).
--! registry ../registries/089-spatial-recurrence-a.reg
--! expect height = 0 1 3 5 7 9 11 13

Cell @ row , Height = prev.Height + prev.prev.Height
